title: "stochtf: stochastic modelling of NANOG/SOX2 dynamics in gene expression noise"
abstract: >-
  Analytical, CME/FSP and stochastic-simulation code for two-site promoter
  models of NANOG and SOX2, with ABC-SMC inference against allele-resolved
  single-cell counts.
